OL,3,GNEWSAOnline access to historical Manx
OL,4,Anewspapers to end
OL,5,
OL,6,FAccess to digital copies of old
OL,7,Fnewspaper titles published on the Isle
OL,8,Fof Man is set to come to an end on
OL,9,FMonday.
OL,11,FThousands of newspapers documenting
OL,12,Fmore than 150 years on the island have
OL,13,Fbeen available to access through
OL,14,FiMuseum for more than a decade.
OL,16,FHowever, Manx National Heritage (MNH),
OL,17,Fwhich holds the original copies in its
OL,18,Fcollections, said the software and
OL,19,Fserver used to provide digital access
OL,20,Fhad become obsolete and would be
OL,21,Fswitched off.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
FL,449,445,260,140,0,100
