OL,3,GNEWSAOnline access to historical Manx
OL,4,Anewspapers to end
OL,5,
OL,6,FHead of collections at MNH, Kirsty
OL,7,FKneate, said the organisation was
OL,8,Fexploring options for a replacement
OL,9,Fsystem that would be both "robust" and
OL,10,F"cost effective going into the future".
